      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE LOUVRE (3) looks ready to fire after two runs back. Placed in a similar race here fresh then got back and charged home late for fourth in an eye-catching run at the tricky Gatton circuit. Strong record course and distance and ready to win. AFFINITY FLYER (5) is fitter for two runs back, the latest when she settled well back over 1200m here and got home late into fifth. Senior rider goes aboard and can do much better. SUPER QUICK (2) finished third last time over 1200m at Esk when resuming from a spell, beaten 0.9 lengths. Aided by the claim and expected to run well. HOOT 'N' HOLLER (8) ran well in a similar race last time and is worth following up. KAREEM (4) beat a host of runners in the previous race with a big weight last time at Esk. Finds a tougher race but goes well course and distance and in form.",
